{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"docfx-mref-page","file":"BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheBinaryLoadDelegate.yml","symbols":[{"uid":"BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheBinaryLoadDelegate","name":"CacheBinaryLoadDelegate","fullName":"BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheBinaryLoadDelegate","kind":"Delegate","namespace":"BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching","assembly":"BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching","summary":"Writes a repeatable binary source into the bounded cache-owned destination.","remarks":"Write the complete logical payload to the supplied bounded destination using the owned token. Never retain, close, or dispose that destination. Use cache-owned scoped services and repeatable source reads because the engine may retry the loader. A joining caller\u0027s delegate may never run. Zero bytes are a positive empty payload. Return BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheBinaryLoadResult.NotFound(BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheEntryDescriptor) only for confirmed source absence. Binary payload handles are opened independently only after storage publication is confirmed.","syntax":{"content":"public delegate ValueTask\u003E CacheBinaryLoadDelegate(CacheLoadContext context, Stream destination, CancellationToken cancellationToken)","parameters":[{"id":"context","type":"BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheLoadContext","description":"The cache-owned source context."},{"id":"destination","type":"System.IO.Stream","description":"The engine-owned destination; loaders must leave it open."},{"id":"cancellationToken","type":"System.Threading.CancellationToken","description":"The owned execution cancellation token."}],"returns":{"type":"System.Threading.Tasks.ValueTask{BridgingIT.DevKit.Common.Result{BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheBinaryLoadResult}}","description":"A descriptor; payload delivery still requires confirmed publication."}},"parameters":[{"id":"context","type":"BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheLoadContext","description":"The cache-owned source context."},{"id":"destination","type":"System.IO.Stream","description":"The engine-owned destination; loaders must leave it open."},{"id":"cancellationToken","type":"System.Threading.CancellationToken","description":"The owned execution cancellation token."}],"returns":{"type":"System.Threading.Tasks.ValueTask{BridgingIT.DevKit.Common.Result{BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheBinaryLoadResult}}","description":"A descriptor; payload delivery still requires confirmed publication."},"parent":"BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching","children":["BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheBinaryLoadDelegate.#ctor(System.Object,System.IntPtr)","BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheBinaryLoadDelegate.BeginInvoke(BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheLoadContext,System.IO.Stream,System.Threading.CancellationToken,System.AsyncCallback,System.Object)","BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheBinaryLoadDelegate.EndInvoke(System.IAsyncResult)","BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheBinaryLoadDelegate.Invoke(BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheLoadContext,System.IO.Stream,System.Threading.CancellationToken)"],"extensionMethods":["BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheBinaryLoadDelegate.BridgingIT.DevKit.Common.LinqFluentExtensions.DoAsync\u0060\u00601(System.Func{BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheBinaryLoadDelegate,System.Threading.CancellationToken,System.Threading.Tasks.Task},System.Threading.CancellationToken)","BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheBinaryLoadDelegate.BridgingIT.DevKit.Common.LinqFluentExtensions.DoAsync\u0060\u00601(System.Func{BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheBinaryLoadDelegate,System.Threading.Tasks.Task},System.Threading.CancellationToken)","BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheBinaryLoadDelegate.BridgingIT.DevKit.Common.LinqFluentExtensions.Do\u0060\u00601(System.Action{BridgingIT.DevKit.Application.Caching.CacheBinaryLoadDelegate})","Brid